  "profileDesc": {
   "abstract": {
    "p": [
     {
      "@xml:lang": "de",
      "#text": "Kondolenzbrief zum Tode von Rinaldo Fulin, der ein herausragendes Mitglied des Reale Istituto Veneto di Scienze, Lettere ed Arti war. Er bittet, sein Beileid auch dem Präsidenten Fedele Lampertico sowie den in Venedig lebenden Mitgliedern des Istituto zu übermitteln."
     },
     {
      "@xml:lang": "en",
      "#text": "Letter of condolence on the death of Rinaldo Fulin, who was an outstanding member of the Reale Istituto Veneto di Scienze, Lettere ed Arti. He asks that his condolences also be given to President Fedele Lampertico and to the members of the Istituto living in Venice."
     }
    ]
   },
